!   5*                                                              CNOP,                                            HB000005
!   6*  217460.00                 100100000000000   AEDMPT          DD(BU,45),0(.3)2(.11)1                           HB000006
!   7*                                                              EXT(0,18)                                        HB000007
!   8*  217460.55                         0437147                   B,AEDUMP                                         HB000007
